 35040 INC HL ; Next byte
 35041 DJNZ 35038 ; Loop for 12 bytes
 35043 POP HL ; Restore the start of the row
 35044 LD B,12 ; B=12 bytes
 35046 RR (HL) ; Rotate right a second time
