 35049 DJNZ 35046 ; Loop for 12 bytes
 35051 DEC C ; One row less
 35052 JR NZ,35035 ; Loop for three rows
 35054 POP HL ; Restore the buffer address
 35055 LD A,(38791) ; A=the car's pixel shift
