 35458 LD B,A ; B=the low byte of the clip position on this row
 35459 BIT 7,H ; Is the left-clip flag (bit 7 of H) set for this row?
 35461 JP NZ,35657 ; Yes: skip the columns left of the street scene first
 35464 LD A,(DE) ; A=the next byte of the buffer at 24119
