; Bar-room animation: figure 7 counter and state
;
; Used by #R36961 for figure 7 (at 18633). The counter counts down to the next change; the state starts at 0 (bit 7 clear: the figure may move).
b36959 DEFB 1 ; Counter
 36960 DEFB 0 ; State

; Bar-room animation: animate figure 7 (at 18633)
c36961 LD A,(36960) ; A=figure 7's state
 36964 AND 128 ; Is bit 7 set (figure 7 is out of action while figure 8 is active)?
